{"product":{"id":10065157062944,"title":"Mezcal XC Trail","body_html":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Hero-maker for Mixed Conditions.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMezcal XC Trail thrives on variety. When the trail delivers an assorment of conditions, you can rely on this legend for quick acceleration and smooth handling across every section of the trail. \u003cbr\u003e \u003cbr\u003eIts continuous center tread rolls fast and efficiently, while siped extensions add climbing grip and dependable braking on mixed terrain. Directional siping on the shoulder knobs—running parallel to the trail with varied widths and open edges—delivers precise, predictable cornering so you can carry speed through every turn.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVittoria’s 4Compound Formulation places four optimized rubber compounds exactly where they’re needed, creating a perfect balance of speed, traction, and long-lasting durability.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Trail casing ties it all together with a tubeless-ready nylon construction, reinforced sidewalls, and an anti-puncture belt—light enough for long rides, strong enough for the roughest lines.\u003c\/p\u003e","vendor":"Vittoria","product_type":"MTB Tire","created_at":"2025-10-02T21:14:03-05:00","handle":"mezcal-xc-trail","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:13:59-05:00","published_at":"2025-11-18T09:05:50-06:00","template_suffix":"xc-trail-template","published_scope":"global","tags":"Cross Country, Discounted products, EP70, IPP40, MTB, Sitewide, Tires, Trail Case, XC\/Down Country","variants":[{"id":50758678544672,"product_id":10065157062944,"title":"26x2.1 \/ Black","price":"96.99","sku":"11A00754","position":1,"compare_at_price":"","fulfillment_service":"manual","inventory_management":"shopify","option1":"26x2.1","option2":"Black","option3":null,"created_at":"2025-10-02T21:14:03-05:00","updated_at":"2026-10-13T09:13:59-05:00","taxable":true,"barcode":"8022530036061","grams":770,"image_id":50972770173216,"weight":770.0